  <two--columns--area data--page--area="" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" style="outline: none;"><h2>For Agents: Orientation</h2><div>Read all of these pages in order <marked-text>at the start of every session</marked-text>. They are short and give the full context needed to work effectively.</div><div><br></div><div>1. This page - overview and links.</div><div>2. <a href="outline/index.page">outline/index.page</a> - what the project is and where it is going.</div><div>3. <a href="guides/index.page">guides/index.page</a> - rules and conventions.</div><div>4. <a href="guides/agent-conduct/index.page">guides/agent-conduct/index.page</a> - how to reason, check in, and manage knowledge.</div><div>5. <a href="boards/tasks.page">boards/tasks.page</a> - what is active right now.</div><div>6. <a href="history/index.page">history/index.page</a> - what happened last session.</div><div><br></div><div>After reading, <marked-text>confirm to the user and wait for direction</marked-text>. Do not read deeper files unprompted.</div></two--columns--area>
